      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "D/C (discharge summary) — Discharge planning evaluation:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " goes in the medical record, and its results are discussed with the patient or their representative."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
