      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "D/C (discharge summary) — Hand-off at discharge:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " send the necessary medical information on the current course of illness and treatment, post-discharge goals of care and treatment preferences to the post-acute providers and practitioners responsible for follow-up care."
     }
